<title>PHILIPPINES: Benpres nine-mth net up at 1.59 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Benpres nine-mth net up at 1.59 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	   (in billion pesos)</p>
<p>    Revenues	   1.66 vs 1.23</p>
<p>    Net income	 1.59 vs 1.18</p>
<p>Note: Full name Benpres Holdings Corporation.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8936</p>
